  "body": "System SYS-SR-11 defines this repository presentation convention. All twelve PROJECT_MODEL_PATHS documents contain one Architecture Overview with a graph and responsibility/boundary explanation. Reuse System structural overview, Skill/CLI/Engineering parent graphs, Validation structural view and Records record graph; retain their prior anchors. Add compact views for Workflow, Assessment, Design, Installation, Packaging and Release using existing model responsibilities. Preserve end-to-end and operational flow graphs, public behavior, exact record format, publication authority and scoped prior adoption. No new submodels/services or runtime schema enforcement, no new universal published skill requirement.",
